(text "DIRECTION SENSE. UP_RET and DN_RET are different nets. Neither joins GND. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nAssumption, not a measurement: each FIELD pin is a switched positive voltage, about 5 V to 24 V, and the matching RET pin is that circuit's return.\\nR30 and R40 are 4.7k on that assumption. At 12 V the LED current is about 2.3 mA. Confirm polarity and voltage before installation.\\nIf the sense wire is not a low-impedance switched positive, change these two resistors. Do not join the two returns on this PCB." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "d181a19e-e11e-46f7-9161-beda4643a5bd"))
